{
  "schema": "doc-card/v1",
  "code": "NL11.3",
  "chapter": "NL11",
  "title": "CG 的收敛率与「为什么必须 SPD」",
  "src": {
    "file": "notebook/math/survey/p9-discrete.tex",
    "sha256": "sha256:5feb96646ad1dab0c6f040977bf978cb2715fb208fc65fc40ecf66cb81654cc3"
  },
  "notebook_commit": "54390093a9c3e0ace557cb26a0a1e9f688d4a220",
  "notebook_dirty": true,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "NL11.3:body.s01",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "是什么",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "误差界：\n\n$$\n\\left\\lVert e_k\\right\\rVert _{A}\\le2\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt\\kappa-1}{\\sqrt\\kappa+1}\\right)^{k}\\left\\lVert e_0\\right\\rVert _{A},\n$$\n\n$\\kappa=\\lambda_{\\max}/\\lambda_{\\min}$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL11.3:body.s02",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "为什么需要",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "它决定「迭代多少次」，也解释「为什么预处理是必要的」（把 $\\kappa$ 压小）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL11.3:body.s03",
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "关键结论",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "$\\kappa$ 大时收敛慢（$\\kappa=10^{4}$ 需要约 $100$ 次以上量级）；\n非 SPD 时 $p^{H}Ap$ 可能为 0 或负，$\\alpha$ 无意义 → 残差停滞或上升。\n成立条件：$A$ 对称正定；精确算术；浮点上收敛会因舍入而偏离界。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL11.3:body.s04",
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "判据",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "非 SPD 的 `apply`（例如未加边界的纯拉普拉斯）必须表现为残差停滞/上升并被\n最大迭代数截断，**不许死循环**。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL11.3:body.s05",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "前置",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "F8、A4、N8。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL11.3:body.s06",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "常见误解",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "以为「CG 对任何矩阵都能用，只是慢一点」。对非对称矩阵它连「下降方向」都无法保证，\n会直接崩；这就是为什么对称性（F5）是硬约束。"
    }
  ],
